# {{cite}}, in Lean

A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization, in progress, of

> {{authors}}, *{{title}}* ({{year}}), <{{url}}>.

It is a paper of the hub [{{hub}}]({{hub_url}}) ({{hub_title}}), in the collection of formalizations
rooted at [lean4-phylogenetics](https://github.com/vltanh/lean4-phylogenetics), one paper per repository.

This page is rewritten when the formalization is done.

## Building

```sh
lake exe cache get
lake build
```

Lean and Mathlib `{{mathlib}}` ([`lean-toolchain`](lean-toolchain),
[`lake-manifest.json`](lake-manifest.json)).

